%% Memory ranking & injection flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Atlas
    participant G as Grisha
    participant M as SQLite (better-sqlite3)
    participant P as Pruner (TTL & Capacity)
    participant R as Summarizer (summarizeForPrompt)
    participant S as Semantic (opt)
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant T as Token Metrics

    Note over O: Request arrives
    O->>M: recall recent entries (Atlas, Grisha)
    Note over M,P: prune() on each write (capacity + TTL)
    O->>R: summarizeForPrompt(targetTokens, half_life)
    R-->>O: ranked block
    opt embeddings enabled
        O->>S: semanticContext(query)
        S-->>O: semantic block
    end
    O->>T: estimate tokens(len/4) + add semantic tokens
    T-->>O: token count (ranked + semantic)
    O->>A: prompt + ranked context
    A-->>O: plan / output
    O->>M: rememberSafe(key facts)
    M->>P: implicit prune (excess + stale)
    O->>T: increment memory_context_injections
    O->>T: add memory_context_tokens
    Note over T: Also track memory_facts_written / pruned
    O->>G: validation with same or trimmed context
    G-->>O: verdict
    O-->>O: metrics pipeline_phase_* updated
